ami\/documentation\/Swami","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onOpenURL(perform:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onOpenURL(perform:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/onopenurl(perform:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onOpenURL"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"perform"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation3URLV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"URL"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ()) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View"}],"title":"onOpenURL(perform:)","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"role":"symbol"}}}